</ul>
</div></section>

<section class="box-note">
<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(Morsch_et_al.)/27:_Biomolecules_-_Lipids/27.01:_Waxes_Fats_and_Oils" class="mt-section"><span id="Study_Notes"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-36482" id="Study_Notes-36482"><span class="lt-icon-default">Study Notes</span></h5>

<p class="lt-chem-36482">You are not expected to memorize the trivial names or formulas of the fatty acids listed in Table \(\PageIndex{1}\). The systematic names for these compounds are shown in the tables below.</p>

