<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(Morsch_et_al.)/27:_Biomolecules_-_Lipids/27.01:_Waxes_Fats_and_Oils" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B2.7D.5C)"></span><h5 class="box-legend" id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B2.7D.5C)-36482"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{2}\)</span></h5>

